Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Reductions: NP is closed downward under polynomial-time
 reductions (mem_NP_of_polyTimeReducible)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The verifier for the reduced language accepts ⟨x, u⟩ when u is within the original bound at f x
and ⟨f x, u⟩ is accepted: an intersection of a length test and a preimage of the original
verifier, both in P by ClassNP/PClosure's closure rows, which the module now imports.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
